# Intentionally untracked. Because this file never reaches a fresh clone, the
# workflows MUST use `npm install` here, not `npm ci` — `npm ci` fails with
# EUSAGE without a lockfile and took master CI red once (#284). If you want
# `npm ci` for tests/, commit this lockfile in the same change.
# CI also passes `--legacy-peer-deps`: npm 10.9.8 + vitest 4.1.x crashes
# arborist `#loadPeerSet` (`edgesOut` of null) on a lockfile-less install
# (npm/cli#8261, 888router#384).
package-lock.json
